    <string name="faq_a1">LifeGuard is Uganda\'s national digital platform for Gender-Based Violence (GBV) and sexual harassment prevention, confidential incident reporting, wearable SOS dispatch, and AI counseling support.</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">Anonymous reporting removes all personal identifiers (name, email, phone) from the submission. You receive a secret tracking token (e.g., TOKEN-LG-123456) to check status without signing in.</string>
